OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,6,Fspells, especially across northern and
OL,7,Feastern Aberdeenshire. More in the way
OL,8,Fof cloud for Upper Deeside but still
OL,9,Fremaining dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with long clear periods
OL,12,Fthis evening for most places. Turning
OL,13,Fcloudier overnight, with a few
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain spreading northeast
OL,15,Fthrough the early hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FPartly cloudy with a few
OL,18,Fshowers at first. Then dry and bright
OL,19,Ffor a time, but turning cloudier with
OL,20,Frain and strengthening winds in the
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
